WEBVTT

00:03:57.664 --> 00:04:01.535
I met Jay Inslee and Naomi Klein
and Bill McKibben

00:04:01.559 --> 00:04:04.159
and the president of the United Nations.

00:04:04.742 --> 00:04:07.035
It was the most amazing week of my life,

00:04:07.059 --> 00:04:10.147
because everyone I knew came together --

00:04:10.171 --> 00:04:12.757
all my teachers, all my classmates ...

00:04:12.781 --> 00:04:17.487
And even some of my favorite stores
closed down to strike for climate.

00:04:18.643 --> 00:04:21.180
If you had asked me why I did all of that,

00:04:21.204 --> 00:04:23.142
my only answer would be,

00:04:23.166 --> 00:04:24.606
"How could I not?"

00:04:25.847 --> 00:04:29.172
It's been one year
since it all started for me,

00:04:29.196 --> 00:04:31.195
and it gets a little tiring at times.